{"ref":"BDB, רִיבַי","hw":"רִיבַי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רִיבַי</span></big>  <strong>n. pr. m.</strong> in Benj., <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:29\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.29\">2 S 23:29</a> (Ρειβα, Εριβα) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.31\">1 Ch 11:31</a> (Ρεβιε, Ρηβαι, Ριβατ, etc.); cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, יְרִיבַי\" href=\"/BDB,_יְרִיבַי\", dir=\"rtl\">יְרִיבַי</a>.","next":"BDB, יָרֵב","prev":"BDB, רִיב²"}